WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:41.042 --> 00:00:43.042
Queen in F6

00:01:03.751 --> 00:01:05.751
- Papa?
- Yes?

00:01:06.209 --> 00:01:09.292
There is something I still cannot fully understand

00:01:09.626 --> 00:01:14.459
- What is that?
- Why do the pieces sacrifice themselves for each other?

00:01:17.000 --> 00:01:18.834
It’s a tactic...

00:01:20.042 --> 00:01:22.542
...within a larger strategy

00:01:24.542 --> 00:01:25.918
Checkmate

00:01:26.334 --> 00:01:28.501
Ultimately protecting...

00:01:29.000 --> 00:01:31.584
...what is most precious to them

00:01:38.417 --> 00:01:39.626
Papa?

00:01:41.626 --> 00:01:42.834
Papa?

00:01:43.042 --> 00:01:44.209
What’s wrong?

00:01:44.417 --> 00:01:45.459
Papa?

00:01:45.667 --> 00:01:48.626
I’m fine, boy. It’s just… It’s just my eyes

00:01:50.042 --> 00:01:52.042
I must go out to buy a new pair of glasses

00:01:53.292 --> 00:01:54.918
Now?

00:01:55.250 --> 00:01:58.292
I won’t be long. We’ll pick up where we left off

00:01:59.083 --> 00:02:01.250
- Can I come with you?
- No. I must go myself

00:02:02.000 --> 00:02:04.000
I’ve told you it’s not safe

00:03:51.626 --> 00:03:52.542
Papa?

00:03:54.209 --> 00:03:56.209
Don’t touch me

00:04:17.125 --> 00:04:18.375
No!

00:04:43.959 --> 00:04:45.959
Nice Eyes and Ears, old man

00:04:47.334 --> 00:04:50.375
Why not give them to someone young enough to enjoy them?

00:04:57.334 --> 00:05:00.626
Militia! Militia!

00:05:01.667 --> 00:05:03.667
Militia! Militia!

00:06:19.501 --> 00:06:21.501
Alright, old boy

00:06:21.792 --> 00:06:23.792
What can I do for you?

00:06:25.250 --> 00:06:27.876
I need a used Immersion System

00:06:28.334 --> 00:06:30.334
Late model with audio-visual

00:06:31.876 --> 00:06:33.501
No olfactory

00:06:33.709 --> 00:06:35.959
You’re not still living with that… thing, are you?

00:06:39.792 --> 00:06:43.083
What’s built from military scavenge
will always be military

00:06:43.334 --> 00:06:45.334
It’s a weapon at heart

00:06:47.417 --> 00:06:48.959
This...

00:06:49.584 --> 00:06:52.834
This came off a guy that was zipped by the militia last week

00:06:53.167 --> 00:06:54.918
Almost perfect condition

00:06:55.167 --> 00:06:58.334
The ID’s not wiped. You'll have to do that yourself

00:07:11.000 --> 00:07:13.709
Look, I didn’t mean anything by…

00:07:14.918 --> 00:07:16.918
You know…

00:07:18.000 --> 00:07:19.292
Militia!

00:07:19.501 --> 00:07:21.792
Oh God. Not again!

00:07:28.459 --> 00:07:29.375
Wait!

00:07:30.334 --> 00:07:34.375
- Sorry, old boy! Every man for himself!
- Let me in!

00:07:35.918 --> 00:07:37.626
This your shack?

00:07:38.584 --> 00:07:40.792
Where did you find that Immersyst?

00:07:54.209 --> 00:07:56.083
Stop!

00:08:07.792 --> 00:08:09.375
Papa?

00:08:09.959 --> 00:08:12.542
- Papa?
- Boy! Go home!

00:08:15.667 --> 00:08:17.667
What’s this?

00:08:18.584 --> 00:08:20.584
Your doll?

00:08:21.542 --> 00:08:23.542
Watch out! It’s unspecked hardware!

00:08:24.167 --> 00:08:26.834
Looks like military grade! Do not engage!

00:08:28.918 --> 00:08:32.709
Well, well, well. What do we have here?

00:08:32.918 --> 00:08:34.584
Let my papa go!

00:08:34.792 --> 00:08:36.792
Oh…

00:08:37.459 --> 00:08:40.125
“Let my papa go”!

00:08:50.375 --> 00:08:51.709
Hey!

00:08:52.334 --> 00:08:53.876
Toaster oven!

00:08:54.083 --> 00:08:56.375
Do you think you’re human?

00:08:57.751 --> 00:09:00.501
- What did you say to me?
- Don’t touch me!

00:09:02.667 --> 00:09:04.667
Please stop!

00:09:07.834 --> 00:09:10.334
Papa?

00:09:13.375 --> 00:09:15.250
Are you my papa?

00:09:15.459 --> 00:09:17.459
Run, boy, run!

00:09:20.876 --> 00:09:21.959
No!

00:09:23.584 --> 00:09:24.876
Stop!

00:10:41.542 --> 00:10:43.876
Conflict ended. Defense mode de-activated

00:11:11.334 --> 00:11:13.250
Papa

00:12:27.042 --> 00:12:29.042
You may come out

00:12:58.209 --> 00:12:59.167
I’m sorry...

00:12:59.834 --> 00:13:01.834
I’m so sorry

00:13:03.959 --> 00:13:05.959
I will make things the way they were before

00:13:09.751 --> 00:13:11.751
I will erase it all away

00:13:29.042 --> 00:13:31.042
I love you papa

00:13:31.626 --> 00:13:33.626
Papa

00:14:40.042 --> 00:14:41.626
Son?

00:14:46.000 --> 00:14:48.792
Papa? Have you been crying?

